{"script":"yd_025_04","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"scaleY":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]嗯……几天前，我在草原上看见的一只好大好大的角猪，让我想起几年前在森林遇到的一朵超大超大的魔花！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]那只魔花真的超级大！比三头角猪加起来还要大！[r]当时我们向它射了几百支箭，却没能让它的行动迟缓分毫！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]面对那种敌人，大家原本都打算放弃了，是一些布宴者站出来，鼓励大家继续战斗。我也被那种气氛感染了，带队又射了几百支箭，才把那朵魔花拿下！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]这说明无论多么强大的敌人，只要坚持战斗就一定能战胜。[r]一百支箭拿不下就射一千支，一千支箭不够就射一万支，任何敌人只要坚持就能拿下！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]怎么样，要和我一起来狩猎那头角猪吗？[r]就算只有我们两个人，也许坚持坚持就能打败它了唷？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"嘉莉缇-熟识1"}